COLORS - Computah OS library
(generated from docs/API.md)

Names for the 16 palette entries, for
gpu.setForeground(colors.red, true): black 0,
darkgray 1, gray 3, silver 6, lightgray 7, white
9, red 10, green 11, blue 12, yellow 13, purple
14, cyan 15, and transparent (-1, for
backgrounds). colors.rgb holds common RGB values
(colors.rgb.orange → 0xFFAA00). These differ from
OpenComputers' colour numbers.
